{"data": {"id": "1400627895", "totalResults": 6645, "items": [{"id": "118f1971-00ad-4ad3-aae4-ca2740f116f6", "quote": "Amazing game. Everything about it is just perfect. The gameplay is fun and exhilarating and the world is fun to explore and packed with things to find. It's also probably one of the prettiest games I've ever played. The spells look amazing. It has that classic From Software feeling put dialed up to 10.\nHowever, the horse is kinda buggy sometimes, but I've rarely had problems with that, especially after the recent patches. I also feel like the crypts get tedious because they are all kinda the same. But there's dogs-I mean, turtles. In short 10/10. Must play", "score": 10, "thumbsUp": null, "thumbsDown": null, "date": "2022-05-04", "author": "Mehrunes", "version": 1651631173000, "spoiler": false, "reviewedProduct": {"id": 1400627895, "type": "games", "title": "Elden Ring", "url": "/game/elden-ring/", "platform": {"id": 1500000128, "name": "PlayStation 5"}, "gameTaxonomy": {"family": {"id": 1200497664, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "title": {"id": 1300501979, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "game": {"id": 1400627895, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "platform": {"id": 1500000128, "name": "PlayStation 5"}}}, "platform": "PlayStation 5"}, {"id": "76693ba5-e4f5-43b7-908b-0cbea1a925e3", "quote": "Classic. Epitome of souls like and character action vidya no joke no cap, fxxk all the sore bxtts", "score": 10, "thumbsUp": null, "thumbsDown": null, "date": "2022-03-19", "author": "Merbot", "version": 1647654703000, "spoiler": false, "reviewedProduct": {"id": 1400627895, "type": "games", "title": "Elden Ring", "url": "/game/elden-ring/", "platform": {"id": 1500000128, "name": "PlayStation 5"}, "gameTaxonomy": {"family": {"id": 1200497664, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "title": {"id": 1300501979, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "game": {"id": 1400627895, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "platform": {"id": 1500000128, "name": "PlayStation 5"}}}, "platform": "PlayStation 5"}, {"id": "90334622-e0b9-4b25-9b88-8adb8d